 ploads/event/images_20260914220720254867.jpeg
DESCRIPTION:With the November 3 General Election approaching\, the Nevada 
 County Democrats and Indivisible Nevada County will host “Ballot Breakdo
 wn: Your Vote. Your Voice. Your Move.” on Monday\, October 5\, from 5:00
 –7:00 p.m. at the Miners Foundry Cultural Center in Nevada City. Doors o
 pen at 4:30 p.m. This event will provide voters with an opportunity to lea
 rn more about the upcoming election\, hear from Nevada County Registrar of
  Voters Armando Salud-Ambriz\, and meet candidates running for local offic
 es\, i
LOCATION:Miners Foundry Cultural Center\, 325 Spring St\, Nevada City\, CA
 \, 95959
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/cadems/event/1035073/
X-SOURCE:Indivisible Yolo (Mobilize)
END:VEVENT
