DESCRIPTION:The Nevada County Democratic Central Committee meets every thi
 rd Wednesday of the month. Doors open at 5:30 pm\, meeting starts at 6:00p
 .m. The location is the new NC Dems Headquarters\, 1200 East Main St. Suit
 e C in Grass Valley. If you would like to become a member of the central c
 ommittee or one of its standing committees\, please email us at nevadacoun
 tydems@gmail.com. Also\, we will be collecting non-perishable foods for ne
 edy families in our community. We need you now more than ever!
LOCATION:1200 E Main St Suite C\, Grass Valley\, CA\, 95945
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/cadems/event/874872/
X-SOURCE:Indivisible Yolo (Mobilize)
END:VEVENT
